{"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":false,"openWorldHint":true,"readOnlyHint":false},"description":"Create a new post (thread) in a Discord forum channel.\n\nTo reply within an existing forum post, use discord_send_message with the post's ID as the channel_id.\n\nArgs:\n  - channel_id (string): Forum channel ID to create the post in\n  - name (string): Post title (max 100 characters)\n  - content (string, optional): Text for the opening message (max 2000 characters)\n  - embeds, files, link_buttons (arrays, optional): Rich content for the opening message\n  - allowed_mentions (object, optional): Limit notifications to the supplied role and user IDs\n  - applied_tags (string[], optional): Tag IDs to apply (max 5, from the forum's available tags)\n  - auto_archive_duration ('60' | '1440' | '4320' | '10080', optional): Minutes before auto-archive\n  - response_format ('markdown' | 'json'): Output format (default: 'json')\n\nReturns:\n  The created forum post details including its ID","execution":{"taskSupport":"forbidden"},"inputSchema":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"allowed_mentions":{"additionalProperties":false,"description":"Limit pings to the supplied user and role IDs. An empty object suppresses all pings.","properties":{"role_ids":{"items":{"description":"Discord role ID (snowflake)","maxLength":20,"minLength":17,"pattern":"^\\d+$","type":"string"},"maxItems":100,"type":"array"},"user_ids":{"items":{"description":"Discord user ID (snowflake)","maxLength":20,"minLength":17,"pattern":"^\\d+$","type":"string"},"maxItems":100,"type":"array"}},"type":"object"},"applied_tags":{"description":"Tag IDs to apply to the post (max 5). Tag IDs come from the forum channel's available_tags","items":{"description":"Discord channel ID (snowflake)","maxLength":20,"minLength":17,"pattern":"^\\d+$","type":"string"},"maxItems":5,"type":"array"},"auto_archive_duration":{"description":"Minutes of in